WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.340
In America, those days, as you know, are over.

00:00:02.340 --> 00:00:04.740
The Trump administration is working,

00:00:04.740 --> 00:00:08.800
and we are continuing to work to track down the villains

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:10.880
that are causing this problem,

00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:15.920
and also, as I said, to get back the 30,000.

00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:17.520
We've already returned.

00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:18.879
Now I think we're going to have another.

00:00:18.879 --> 00:00:20.280
We're going to find a lot.

00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:21.480
You're not going to find all of them.

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:23.680
Three hundred. More than 300,000.

00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:26.660
They're lost or they're dead.

00:00:26.719 --> 00:00:28.719
They're lost or they're dead

00:00:28.719 --> 00:00:30.860
because of the animals that did this.

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.099
To protect our citizens,

00:00:33.099 --> 00:00:37.660
I've also designated multiple savage drug cartels

00:00:37.660 --> 00:00:39.799
as far as to — and you see this,

00:00:39.799 --> 00:00:41.639
and you see it happening right before your eyes.

